# Browser
# Fire Lord Sozin at a table, Bot1 a browser page: "you may pay {X}" is answered with the dock's X stepper (raised to 1) and its pay
# button, and the reflexive ability's targets - "any number of target creature cards with total mana value X or less" (CR 601.2c) -
# are clicked in Bot2's graveyard, the dock keeping the running total against X. Guerrilla Gorilla (2) is worth more than X by
# itself and is no candidate, so three are offered: Ornithopter (0) and the two Llanowar Elves (1 each). Ornithopter and one Elves
# make 1 and enter under Bot1's control; the other Elves would have taken the total over and stays.

